{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國檢察官稱，這名被指控在OpenAI辦公場所私裝竊聽設備的工程師，錄下了該公司與外國政府的會談內容，還拍攝了保密文件。檢方在周一提交的法庭文件中表示，目前已從沙特籍嫌疑人阿卜杜勒拉赫曼・阿爾福贊的個人筆記本電腦中查獲數百份音頻文件，其中至少包含一段OpenAI與外國政府代表的會談錄音。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587816.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.395701+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:53:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"12b70d42b627f869f3d40c3acef4f1206cf16cd7c53dcc27ad428c47f70226c6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}